            "value" : "「ノー」をもらうたびに、「イエス」に一歩近づく。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every approach is practice for the one that works." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
