            "value" : "声をかけたことがない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never fear rejection, fear a life of regretting." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Fürchte nie die Zurückweisung, fürchte ein Leben voller Reue."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nunca le temas al rechazo; témele a una vida de arrepentimientos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ne crains jamais le rejet, crains une vie de regrets."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "拒絶を恐れるな。後悔し続ける人生を恐れよ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No approach is wasted; it either works or reveals what to change." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Kein Ansprechen ist verschwendet: Entweder es klappt, oder du siehst, was du ändern musst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ningún acercamiento se desperdicia: o funciona o te muestra qué cambiar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Aucune approche n’est perdue : soit elle marche, soit elle te montre quoi changer."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "無駄なアプローチはない。うまくいくか、何を変えるべきかがわかるかのどちらかだ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No one can make you feel inferior without your consent." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Niemand kann dir ohne deine Zustimmung das Gefühl geben, minderwertig zu sein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nadie puede hacerte sentir inferior sin tu consentimiento."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Personne ne peut te faire sentir inférieur sans ton consentement."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "自分が同意しない限り、誰にも劣等感を抱かされることはない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No, I usually go for it" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nein, ich mache es meistens"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nunca, yo me lanzo"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Non, en général je me lance"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "いいえ、たいてい声をかけます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Non-negotiables" : {
