    "Start where you are. Use what you have. Do what you can." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Fang da an, wo du bist. Nutze, was du hast. Tu, was du kannst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Empieza donde estás. Usa lo que tienes. Haz lo que puedas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Commence là où tu es. Utilise ce que tu as. Fais ce que tu peux."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "今いる場所から始めよう。持っているものを使おう。できることをしよう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success is not final, failure is not fatal: It is the courage to continue that counts." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolg ist nicht endgültig, Scheitern ist nicht tödlich: Was zählt, ist der Mut weiterzumachen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El éxito no es definitivo, el fracaso no es fatal: lo que cuenta es el valor para continuar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Le succès n’est pas final, l’échec n’est pas fatal : c’est le courage de continuer qui compte."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "成功は終着点ではなく、失敗は致命的ではない。大切なのは、続ける勇気だ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success is the sum of small efforts repeated day in and day out." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolg ist die Summe kleiner Anstrengungen, Tag für Tag wiederholt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El éxito es la suma de pequeños esfuerzos repetidos día tras día."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Le succès est la somme de petits efforts, répétés jour après jour."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "成功とは、毎日繰り返す小さな努力の積み重ねだ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success is walking from failure to failure with no loss of enthusiasm." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolg heißt, von Misserfolg zu Misserfolg zu gehen, ohne die Begeisterung zu verlieren."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El éxito consiste en ir de fracaso en fracaso sin perder el entusiasmo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Le succès, c’est d’aller d’échec en échec sans perdre son enthousiasme."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "成功とは、熱意を失わずに、失敗から失敗へと歩み続けることだ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Successful people willingly do what unsuccessful people are unwilling to do." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolgreiche Menschen tun bereitwillig, was erfolglose nicht tun wollen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Las personas exitosas hacen con gusto lo que las demás no están dispuestas a hacer."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ceux qui réussissent font volontiers ce que les autres refusent de faire."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "成功する人は、成功しない人がやりたがらないことを進んでやる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swing the bat — home runs don't happen from the bench." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ran an den Ball – von der Ersatzbank aus schießt niemand Tore."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Entra a la cancha: desde la banca no se meten goles."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tente ta chance : on ne marque pas depuis le banc de touche."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "バットを振ろう。ベンチからホームランは生まれない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Opener" : {
      "comment" : "Course title.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der Opener"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
