          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Want more confidence in general" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Allgemein mehr Selbstvertrauen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Quiero tener más confianza en mí mismo"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Avoir plus confiance en moi"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "全般的にもっと自信をつけたい"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We don't grow when things are easy. We grow when we face challenges." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wir wachsen nicht, wenn es leicht ist. Wir wachsen, wenn wir uns Herausforderungen stellen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No crecemos cuando las cosas son fáciles. Crecemos cuando enfrentamos retos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "On ne grandit pas quand tout est facile. On grandit face aux défis."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "物事が簡単なとき、人は成長しない。困難に向き合うときに成長する。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We may encounter many defeats but we must not be defeated." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wir mögen viele Niederlagen erleben, aber wir dürfen uns nicht besiegen lassen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Puede que suframos muchas derrotas, pero no debemos ser derrotados."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nous connaîtrons peut-être bien des défaites, mais nous ne devons pas être vaincus."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "何度も敗北に出会うかもしれない。だが、打ち負かされてはならない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you’re not changing, you’re choosing." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Was du nicht änderst, wählst du."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lo que no estás cambiando, lo estás eligiendo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ce que tu ne changes pas, tu le choisis."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "変えようとしないものは、自分で選んでいるものだ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whatever the mind of man can conceive and believe, it can achieve." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Was der menschliche Geist sich vorstellen und glauben kann, kann er auch erreichen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Todo lo que la mente humana puede concebir y creer, lo puede lograr."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tout ce que l’esprit humain peut concevoir et croire, il peut le réaliser."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "人が心に思い描き、信じられることは、すべて実現できる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it feels scary to jump, that is exactly when you jump." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn sich der Sprung beängstigend anfühlt, genau dann springst du."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cuando saltar te da miedo, ese es justo el momento de saltar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Quand sauter fait peur, c’est justement le moment de sauter."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "跳ぶのが怖いと感じるとき、それこそが跳ぶべきときだ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether you think you can or think you can't, you are right." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ob du denkst, du kannst es, oder du kannst es nicht – du hast recht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tanto si crees que puedes como si crees que no, tienes razón."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Que tu penses être capable ou ne pas être capable, tu as raison."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "できると思っても、できないと思っても、どちらも正しい。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within the past month" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
